  "Prepare a private Linux desktop on the machine running DSH. The first preparation downloads the published image, or builds the bundled recipe when no image is published.": "在运行 DSH 的机器上准备私有 Linux 桌面。首次准备会下载已发布镜像；没有发行镜像时按内置配方构建。",
  "Windows App Installer must be available. Cancelling stops DSH preparation; an elevated Windows installer may continue and installed components are kept.": "需要 Windows 应用安装程序。取消将停止 DSH 准备任务；已提权的 Windows 安装器可能继续运行，已安装的组件会保留。",
