  "Current home hard quota": "当前桌面目录硬配额",
  "Home quotas require XFS project quotas and a kernel enforcement check. They apply only to new homes; existing homes and engine disk space are not resized.": "硬配额需要 XFS 项目配额，并通过内核强制限制检查。仅用于新建桌面目录，不调整已有目录或引擎磁盘大小。",
  "This engine does not support managed persistent home quotas. Warning levels remain available.": "此引擎不支持受管持久目录硬配额，仍可设置容量告警。",
  "This engine cannot enforce persistent home quotas. Use Podman on XFS with project quotas.": "此引擎无法强制执行持久目录配额，需要使用支持 XFS 项目配额的 Podman。",
  "Installing Windows desktop components": "正在安装 Windows 桌面运行组件",
