  "Install WSL and the selected engine on the Windows machine running DSH? This accepts the Windows Package Manager source and package agreements. Review the engine licensing terms and complete any Windows permission or installer prompts.": "在运行 DSH 的 Windows 主机上安装 WSL 和所选容器引擎？继续即接受 Windows 软件包管理器的软件源及软件包协议。请查看引擎许可条款，并处理 Windows 权限或安装器提示。",
  "Windows may need a restart. DSH will not restart your computer. Reopen DSH afterward to continue the approved preparation; completed system steps are not repeated.": "Windows 可能需要重启，DSH 不会自动重启电脑。重启后重新打开 DSH，即可继续已授权的准备任务，不会重复已完成的系统步骤。",
  "Accept and install": "接受并安装",
